{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Hey hey hey [Cm]hey, aa aa aa [F]aa,        [F]La la la la, [Gm]aa aa aa
[Gm]Main agar saamne aa bhi [F]jaya karu,        [D#]Laazmi hai ke tum mujhse [F]parda karo
[Gm]Apni shaadi ke din ab [F]nahin door hai
Mai bhi [D#]tadpa karu tum bhi [F]tadpa karo,        [Gm]Badi mushkil hai, yeh mera dil hai
[Cm]Tum hi [F]kaho kaise main chup [Gm]rahu,        [Gm]Hey hey hey [Cm]hey, aa aa aa [F]aa
[F]La la la la, [Gm]aa aa aa,        [Gm]Sataane ke manaane [Cm]ke
Yeh din hai [F]aazmaane [Gm]ke,        Zara [D#]samjha karo [F]dilbar,
tumhe [Gm]meri kasam,        [Gm]Yehi meri hai maj [Cm]boori
Sehi [F]jaaye na ab [Gm]doori,        Mera kya [D#]haal hai [F]kaise
bataaoon [Gm]main sanam,        Zameen [F]hogi, gagan [Gm]hoga
Tera [F]mera milan [Gm]hoga,        [Gm]Main agar tumse nazre [F]milaya karu
[D#]Laazmi hai ke tum mujhse [F]parda karo,        [Gm]Main duniya se [Cm]chala jaaoon
Kabhi na [F]lautke aa [Gm]oon,        Karogi [D#]kya akele [F]tum,
bataao [Gm]dilrooba,        [Gm]Main rab se [Cm]chheen laaoongi
Tujhe [F]apna banaa [Gm]oongi,        Chalegi [D#]saans jab [F]tak yeh
na honge [Gm]hum judaa,        [Gm]Na apni yeh [F]kasam toote
[Gm]Jo rab roothe to [F]rab roothe,        [Gm]Main agar tumko milne [F]bulaaya karu
